msgid "Enabling this sensor will allow the Home Assistant application to track your location and report it back to your instance of Home Assistant. Ensure that you enable background access to location, otherwise we cannot enable location tracking. Your location data is sent directly to your Home Assistant instance and is never sent to a 3rd party."
